{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28101","headline":"塞上宿野寺 · 雍陶","name":"塞上宿野寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"塞上蕃僧老，天寒疾上关。\n远烟平似水，高树暗如山。\n去马朝常急，行人夜始闲。\n更深听刁斗，时到磬声间。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"雍陶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_28101.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_28101","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}